   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Everyone get to work, quickly!' The chef calls everybody to order with a sharp command.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "А ты иди переодевайся!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And you, go get changed!' He uses the informal command form to order Max to change into kitchen whites.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Шеф, я готов.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Chef, I am ready.' Max addresses the boss with the standard kitchen title and short adjective.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Что мне делать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What should I do?' the basic verb form construction asks what action is expected of him.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Почему ты пришёл на эту кухню?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why did you come to this kitchen?' The past-tense verb indicates arrival at the location.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Потому что я повар.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
