   "t": "'Because I am a cook.' Max explains his background with the direct conjunction.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я настоящий профессионал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am a true professional.' He proudly asserts his culinary qualifications.",
   "gap": 0.4
